-- 3) pharmacists (3 rows) — exercises /pharmacists' card grid + the
--    upcoming/completed correlated-subquery counts + the delete-guard's
--    exact condition (`status IN ('pending','confirmed') AND
--    appointment_date >= CURDATE()`). ALL THREE rows set `image_url = NULL`
--    on purpose — see PHARMACIST_CARD_MARKER's own doc comment in
--    infra/e2e/lib/extract.mjs for why every card needs the dicebear-avatar
--    fallback to fire for this harness's per-card delimiter to work.
--
--      - 7701 'สมชาย ใจดี' — is_active=1, is_available=1, fee=150 (not
--        free), duration=20. ONE 'pending' appointment 3 days in the future
--        (7731) -> upcomingCount=1 -> DELETE-GUARD BLOCKED (mirrors
--        pharmacists.php's/pharmacists/actions.ts's own guard query
--        exactly). TWO 'completed' appointments in the past (7732/7733) ->
--        completedCount=2.
--      - 7702 'สมหญิง รักยา' — specialty='' (empty, NOT NULL — exercises
--        the `?: 'เภสัชกรทั่วไป'` / `|| 'เภสัชกรทั่วไป'` fallback on both
--        stacks), is_active=1, is_available=0 (no green "available" dot),
--        fee=0 (the "ฟรี" free-label branch). ONE 'completed' appointment
--        in the past (7734) -> completedCount=1. ONE 'cancelled'
--        appointment 5 days in the FUTURE (7735) — deliberately adversarial:
--        proves upcomingCount's `status IN ('pending','confirmed')` clause
--        excludes a future-but-cancelled row, not just a past one -> still
--        upcomingCount=0 -> DELETE-GUARD CLEAR despite having a
--        future-dated appointments row at all.
--      - 7703 'วิชัย ตรวจโรค' — is_active=0 (the `opacity-60` card-dimming
--        branch), is_available=0. Zero appointments rows at all ->
--        upcomingCount=0, completedCount=0 -> trivially DELETE-GUARD CLEAR.
-- ===========================================================================
